Error [E0112]: `invalidate` wants WebQuery for argument 1, but this is String (text)
  --> tests/ui/web_suite_query_type_mismatch.jet:5:22
    |
  5 |     query.invalidate("wrong-query")
    |                      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Every argument must match its parameter's type
 Fix: Use WebQuery here
